== Quest Start ==
Talk to Dason Goldblade in the [[Plane of Sky]].

You say, 'Hail, Dason Goldblade'
:''Dason Goldblade says, 'Greetings, Tify.  Are you [pure of heart and soul]?' ''
You say, 'pure of heart and soul'
:''Dason Goldblade says, 'Then choose your test.  The test of the heart is in three parts.  [Compassion], [sacrifice] and [love]. The only other test, is of your [spirit].' ''

== Paladin Test of Compassion ==

You say, 'Compassion'
:''Dason Goldblade says, 'Compassion is of great importance to us.  Without it, we do not feel empathy, and cannot truly follow the path we claim to travel.  Return to me an efreeti zweihander, large sky diamond and a wind rune izah.  If you present these to me, I will award you Truvinan, the divine wind.' ''

'''Reward:''' {{:Truvinan}}

